        },
        {
          "text": "Yotamu ovu de eli be kali iri drini towi erini e’dozu opi nyazurisi, eri nva opi Yerusalemua eli mudri drini azia, Andri ma ru Yerusa, Zadoki zi’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
